# Encrypted broker credential material (Fernet-encrypted JSON per elements_v2.md §1.2)
*credentials*.json
*creds*.json

# Non-Plane artifacts only (logs/ per directory_structure.md) — never commit these anyway
logs/*
!logs/.gitkeep

# pg_dump staging (Backblaze pipeline) — binary/compressed backup artifacts only.
# databases/schema/ (extracted DDL — the source-of-truth schema artifacts) IS tracked;
# directory_structure.md explicitly scopes "auxiliary DB files" into this directory,
# and a blanket databases/* rule silently defeated that. Never the PG cluster itself
# (that lives at the OS-default location per elements_v2.md, outside ~/nix entirely).
databases/*.dump
databases/*.sql.gz
databases/*.tar
databases/backups/

# Node-identity / runtime state (state/ — hardware UUID, credential JSON). Not for a
# public repo: the hardware UUID is machine-fingerprinting info, not a secret exactly,
# but not something to publish either. credentials.json is already covered above by
# *credentials*.json but state/ is excluded wholesale for defense in depth.
state/

# Env / master-password material
*.env
.env
*master_password*
*master-password*

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
.testmondata

# macOS cruft (not part of the tracked tree)
.DS_Store
._*

# graphify working output (not part of this arc's scope)
graphify-out/
